-- 1. the reuse window ---------------------------------------
  ⭐ The SAME command, the SAME file. The only thing that changes is
  how many seconds have passed since the previous run.

     GAP_S         MS   MOUNTS
         0       12.2        1
         2       14.4        1
         4       13.6        1
         6       82.2        1
        10       92.7        1

  ⭐ THE MOUNT IS TORN DOWN BETWEEN 4s AND 6s AFTER THE LAST RUN.
  Across that boundary the same command costs 82.2 ms instead of 12.2 ms
  -- 6.76x, decided by nothing but elapsed time.

